[break] nothing-waits-for-an-epoch
rule: A key that takes effect at the next epoch waits for it, and is taken when a compaction begins one.
file: crates/cortex-core/src/reload.rs
in: set_next_epoch
find:
    live.handle.at_next_epoch(Some(EpochChange {
        models,
        context,
        taken: Some(taken),
    }));
replace:
    drop((models, context, taken));
caught-by:
    cortex-core::it reload::what_waits_for_the_next_epoch_comes_in_with_a_compaction

[break] old-news-is-told-again
rule: Only what is new is told to a session's clients; a reload that changed nothing says so to the person who asked.
file: crates/cortex-core/src/reload.rs
in: reload_session
find: || waits != waited
replace: || !waits.is_empty()
caught-by:
    cortex-core::it reload::a_reload_applies_what_takes_effect_at_once_and_lists_what_waits

[break] the-slot-is-taken-at-a-turns-start
rule: What waits for the next epoch is not taken at a turn's start.
